				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d9bddc4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="d9bddc4" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3b6894b" data-id="3b6894b" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2dc31ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2dc31ce" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h3>Private Excursions in RIVIERA MAYA</h3>
<p><span style="color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;">Planning a <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/private-excursion-4-cenotes-and-private-beach/">private excursion</a> could be one of the most comfortable and simplest things you ever did on your vacation! Not only would it put your mind at ease that you won&#8217;t be waiting around for other people, it would also help your journey become more comfortable and enjoyable. </span></p>
<p><span style="color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;">We will take care of everything for you from start to finish. All you have to do it just turn up, relax and enjoy your day. </span></p>
<p><span style="color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;">Some of our most popular private tours Playa del Carmen include visiting <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/culture-and-ruins/tulum-coba-cenote/">Tulum</a>, Bacalar, <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/culture-and-ruins/chichen-itza-trip-mt/">Chichén</a> Itzá, Private Beach, <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/culture-and-ruins/tulum-coba-cenote/">Coba</a>, <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/nature-tours/akumal-turtles-cenote/">Akumal</a>, and City Tour in <a href="https://turismochannel.net/transfers-1/private-transfer-from-cancun-airport-to-tulum/">Cancun</a>.</span></p>
<h3><strong>Explore Chichén Itzá</strong></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">By having this <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/private-excursion-4-cenotes-and-private-beach/">private excursion</a> tour, you will discover the mysteries of Mayans with a full day tour. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can also visit Chichén Itzá, which is named one of the New 7 Wonders of the World for being one of the world&#8217;s best-preserved ancient cities. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We will guide you to learn about almost all of the important historical buildings. From the amazing Pyramid of El Castillo or El Caracol to the wonderful Pyramid of Kukulcan that once housed ten thousand people of Mayans.&nbsp; </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This private tour to Chichen Itza will guarantee you to learn about all the incredible stories, stunning details, and more exciting journeys along the way.</span></p>
<h3><strong>Private Cenote Tour</strong></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Get ready to swim in the crystal clear water of <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/private-excursion-4-cenotes-and-private-beach/">Cenotes</a> and experience the fun of swimming in the underground cenote cave. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You will lose yourself in the local history, culture, and wonderful stories from your guide. We will assure you to connect with nature as you swim in awe on the crystal clear water of the Cenote.</span></p>
<h3>Cancun City Tour</h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you’re more interested in the city, you can enlighten yourself with the <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/private-excursion-city-tour-in-cancun/">Cancun City Tour</a> where you will explore and experience the ancient ruins. You will see the perfect details of many historical carvings and stone structures. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For sure, you will also learn about the rich history and culture of the ancient Maya with the resourceful commentary on one of the New 7 Wonders of the World. With its amazing and stunning views, we will also make sure that you can save the moment by taking a picture at the sites with your family and friends.</span></p>
<h3><strong>Holbox Tour</strong></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">But let’s not forget our <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/island-tours/isla-holbox/">Holbox Tour</a>! By exploring the Holbox island, you can also visit and explore its neighboring islands on this full-day tour. There are many varieties of wildlife, marine life, and the colorful boats and houses. You can also see migratory birds on Pasion Island. With a relaxed boat tour, you will be assured to have the most enjoyable experience anyone can ever have on Holbox island. Our guide will also guide you to the site where over 300 different species of birds live freely and you can look for whitehead eagles, cormorants, flamingos, and ducks as you cross a lagoon to Isla Pasion.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Wondering what kind of cuisine you will be having during this private tour? Stress not! Our guide will take you to many of our local restaurants where you can experience the unique cuisines from each of the trips. Or you can e</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">njoy a buffet lunch where you’ll have the freedom to choose the cuisine you like best.</span></p>
<h4><span style="font-weight: 400;">What are you waiting for? </span></h4>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Choose your first destination now for your Playa del Carmen private excursions!</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				</div>
				<footer data-elementor-type="footer" data-elementor-id="5000" class="elementor elementor-5000 elementor-location-footer" data-elementor-post-type="elementor_library">
					<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7d9cad8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="7d9cad8" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a777863" data-id="a777863" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-713c392 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="713c392" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">What our guests are saying about us...</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0efbd6f elementor-arrows-yes elementor-pagination-type-bullets elementor-review--has-separator elementor--star-style-star_fontawesome elementor-widget elementor-widget-reviews" data-id="0efbd6f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;slides_per_view&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;show_arrows&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pagination&quot;:&quot;bullets&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;autoplay&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;autoplay_speed&quot;:5000,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_hover&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;pause_on_interaction&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="reviews.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-swiper">
					<div class="elementor-main-swiper swiper" role="region" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Slides">
				<div class="swiper-wrapper">
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial elementor-repeater-item-be3b059">
							<a class="elementor-testimonial__header" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g150812-d10520892-r610049588-Turismo_Channel-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
							<img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-l/1a/f6/e6/ea/default-avatar-2020-54.jpg" alt="BravoFamilyTravels">
													</div>
										<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">BravoFamilyTravels</span><div class="elementor-star-rating"><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i></div><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">@BravoFamilyTravels</span></cite>					<div class="elementor-testimonial__icon elementor-icon elementor-icon-tripadvisor" aria-label="Read More"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-tripadvisor"></i></div>				</a>
										<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Turismo Channel was great!!! Their office was located in our hotel in Playa del Carmen and the booking process was easy and smooth. They were on time for pick up. The car was a compact car but plenty of space for our family of four. It was clean and comfortable. Vanessa was our tour guide and she really made the trip enjoyable. My husband and I were traveling with our young kids so we don't like to join group tours. That way we can run on our own schedule and have flexibility without impacting other people. We went to Kantun Chi to swim/snorkel at the four cenotes at the location. Vanessa guided us through the eco park. Continued...					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial elementor-repeater-item-92015ab">
							<a class="elementor-testimonial__header" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g150812-d10520892-r621901972-Turismo_Channel-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
							<img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-l/1a/f6/e4/59/default-avatar-2020-49.jpg" alt="kahoward63">
													</div>
										<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">kahoward63</span><div class="elementor-star-rating"><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i></div><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">@kahoward63</span></cite>					<div class="elementor-testimonial__icon elementor-icon elementor-icon-tripadvisor" aria-label="Read More"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-tripadvisor"></i></div>				</a>
										<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Ms. Vanessa Cardenas and Oliver Jiminez are absolutely incredible and delightful hosts! This was our second encore vacation trip utilizing their travel services due to our fabulous first time experience! Oliver and Vanessa provided all of our transportation and private tour services from The Cancun International airport to Playa Del Carmen, Xel-Ha Park, Tulum, Coba Ruins and Isle de Mujures! They were always dependable - early and on time! They created a perfect itinerary for us and delivered it with superb, friendly service! We will be back! Highly Recommend!!!!!					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial elementor-repeater-item-12f316c">
							<a class="elementor-testimonial__header" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g150812-d10520892-r591691745-Turismo_Channel-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
							<img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-l/05/fc/bb/55/trvrmrtn.jpg" alt="TrvrMrtn">
													</div>
										<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">TrvrMrtn</span><div class="elementor-star-rating"><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i></div><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">@TrvrMrtn</span></cite>					<div class="elementor-testimonial__icon elementor-icon elementor-icon-tripadvisor" aria-label="Read More"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-tripadvisor"></i></div>				</a>
										<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Best experience I’ve ever had when renting a car. We were disappointed by another rental company this morning, so I reached out to Vanessa from Turismo Channel to ask if she could arrange a car on short notice. She replied quickly and while I was walking towards their office she prepared the contract. I was outside again and driving the car very quickly and this saved our last vacation day in Playa. Prices are very fair and the car was in great shape. Everything was so much better and more personal then renting via the bigger and well known companies. Highly recommended and a big thanks to Vanessa!					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial elementor-repeater-item-a85b804">
							<a class="elementor-testimonial__header" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g150812-d10520892-r816693978-Turismo_Channel-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
							<img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-l/1a/f6/ea/2e/default-avatar-2020-67.jpg" alt="Caryn D">
													</div>
										<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Caryn D</span><div class="elementor-star-rating"><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i></div><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">@caryndavies</span></cite>					<div class="elementor-testimonial__icon elementor-icon elementor-icon-tripadvisor" aria-label="Read More"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-tripadvisor"></i></div>				</a>
										<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Vanessa arranged a car rental for us to tour Tulum and Casa Cenote in our own time. Such fantastic, friendly & helpful service, sending transport to collect us from our hotel and dropping us off afterwards. Turisma also with so many tips and a fabulous restaurant referral. Fabulous experience thank you!					</div>
				</div>
					</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide">
									<div class="elementor-testimonial elementor-repeater-item-48e76ce">
							<a class="elementor-testimonial__header" href="https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g150812-d10520892-r831493697-Turismo_Channel-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html">
											<div class="elementor-testimonial__image">
							<img src="https://media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-l/1a/f6/ea/b2/default-avatar-2020-69.jpg" alt="Susyluna80">
													</div>
										<cite class="elementor-testimonial__cite"><span class="elementor-testimonial__name">Susyluna80</span><div class="elementor-star-rating"><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i><i class="elementor-star-full">&#xE934;</i></div><span class="elementor-testimonial__title">@Susyluna80</span></cite>					<div class="elementor-testimonial__icon elementor-icon elementor-icon-tripadvisor" aria-label="Read More"><i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-tripadvisor"></i></div>				</a>
										<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						Gracias al gran servicio de la agencia Turismo Channel, siempre atentos desde que fueron por nosotros al hotel. La experiencia estuvo de lujo, recomiendo ampliamente sus servicios. Especialmente la atención de Vanesa que nos dio toda la información. El recorrido precioso, la experiencia de snorkel y el Jeep maravillosas. Espero regresar pronto!					</div>
				</div>
